  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall not be occupied until details and location of short and long (with details of a covered, accessible and secure enclosure) cycle storage to meet London Plan Standards has been submitted to, and approved in writing by the local planning authority. The development shall be carried out in accordance with the details as so agreed, and the storage provision shall be in place prior to the first occupation of the development, and retained thereafter.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;0100/P01 – Location and Site Plan; SW/PLN/24/40/01 – Existing Floor Plans; SW/PLN/24/40/02 – Existing Elevations; SW/PLN/24/40/03 – Proposed Floor Plans; SW/PLN/24/40/04 – Proposed Elevations; Accommodation Management Plan&amp;nbsp; (received 17.12.24); SW/PLN/24/41/01 – Existing Plans and Elevations [Outbuilding]&amp;nbsp; (received 17.12.24); Planning Statement (received 17.12.24); Fire Safety – Reasonable Exemption Statement; General Waste Disposal Details; Council Dept Letter of Support (dated 02.09.24 and received 17.12.24)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All plans received and valid 05.11.24, unless otherwise stated&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The site shall only be used as a Residential Children&#x27;s Care Home and not for any other uses falling within Use Class (C2), or for any other purposes, unless an alternative use is agreed in writing by the local planning authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The new Residential Care Home hereby permitted shall not be occupied by more than 6.no children and 3.no members of staff at any given time. The development shall be operated in accordance with the hereby approved management plan at all times in perpetuity (unless any substantive changes are otherwise agreed in writing with the LPA).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission."
  ],
